# Build context for the optional `ai` image only.
#
# BuildKit prefers <Dockerfile>.dockerignore over the root .dockerignore, so this
# file exists to undo exactly one line of it: the root list excludes `ai/` as
# "context weight", which is correct for the four images that never read that
# directory and wrong for this one, whose Dockerfile does `COPY ai/`. Everything
# else is inherited verbatim, so the context here is as small as it is elsewhere.
#
# The image copies two files from docker/ — the rest of the tree is only
# context weight. The AiPBX source is cloned inside the container, so nothing
# here ends up in the image.
.git
.github
.env
arenv
src
aipbx.git
android
ios
chat
docs
sounds
evidence
node_modules
**/node_modules
web/vendor
**/*.zip
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.pdf
